'''Rebels''' was a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] subsidiary organization of [[Team Empire]]. <ref name="rebels subsidiary">{{cite web|url=https://www.reddit.com/r/GlobalOffensive/comments/43jdfl/team_empire_announces_csgo_team/cziwl9n?context=3|date=2016-01-31|title=Rebels a subsidiary organization of Team Empire|author=[[ub1que]]}}</ref>

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2015
|name2=2016
|This=2

|content2=
* January 31st - '''Rebels''' officially join [[Team Empire]] - presumably the organization that bought them out from [[Arcade eSports]]. <ref name="Rebels join Empire">{{cite web|url=http://team.empire.gg/news/2577/|title=Team Empire открывает состав по CS:GO!|date=2016-01-31|publisher=Team Empire|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian |trans_title=Team Empire opens the composition of the CS:GO!}}</ref>

|content1=
* Dec 11th - '''Rebels''' forms from ex-[[Arcade eSports]]. [[arch]], [[fix]], [[CyberFocus]], [[spaz]], and [[spiker]] join. <ref name="Arcade agree to sell team">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/16355-arcade-agree-to-sell-team|title=Arcade agree to sell team|date=2015-11-11|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
* Dec 15th - [[arch]] leaves to join [[Team YP]], [[electronic]] replaces him.
}}

