* September 5th - '''regain''' part ways with [[cbd]] and add [[Lucid]]. <ref name="+Lucid">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/regaincs/status/1566968016700690433|title=As we head into tonight's match we would like to give a special welcoming to our latest member @Its_Lucid_|date=2022-09-05|author='''regain'''}}</ref>
