* December 11th - [[dvrk]] steps down from '''regain'''. <ref name="-dvrk">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/dvrk_csgo/status/1734314324397875370|title=dvrk leaves regain|date=2023-12-11|author=[[dvrk]]}}</ref>

|content3=
