* August 29th - '''regain''' reforms after [[ASPYRE]] part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-aspyre">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/65550/regain-reform-with-marekiew-after-leaving-aspyre|title=regain reform with marekiew after leaving ASPYRE|date=2025-08-29|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* February 5th - [[fuzenko]] steps down from '''regain'''. <ref name="-fuzenko">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/regaincs/status/2019560923707662526|title=our last post was not a joke btw, we are now lf1|date=2026-02-05|author='''regain'''}}</ref>
* March 6th - [[marekiew]] steps down from '''regain'''. <ref name="-marekiew">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/71382/marekiew-steps-down-from-regain-due-to-work-commitments|title=marekiew steps down from regain due to work commitments|date=2026-03-06|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
