* September 3rd - '''regain''' part ways with [[dvrk]] and [[H0NeST]]. <ref name="-dvrk, honest">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/77511/dvrk-and-h0nest-step-down-from-regain|title=dvrk and H0NeST step down from regain|date=2026-09-03|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* September 23rd '''regain''' add [[fuzenko]] and [[z0mb1e]]. <ref name="z0mb1e">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/78162/regain-return-to-full-strength-with-fuzenko-and-z0mb1e|title=regain return to full strength with fuzenko and z0mb1e|date=2026-09-23|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
